    </blockList>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[In the the excitement of a match it is sometimes difficult for players, club officials and parents to take an objective and balanced view about any match their team is involved in. Whether you're watching or playing, please keep this code of conduct in mind.]]></Value>
    </description>
